summary:
  The first heartbeat tick after a wake dates the order instead of asking the door.

history:
  A dead stream still shows Playing after a wake (measured 2026-09-29), so a
  late tick that wrote now counted last night's station as heard this morning.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
              else if (!root._casting) _orderLapsed();

replace:
              else if (!root._casting) root._orderHeardAt = now;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_deadline_counts_from_when_the_order_was_last_heard.
  Line-neutral.
